    "Estimated from your weight, the scale's electrical resistance measurement, height, age and sex. Good for following trends, not a medical measurement.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Geschätzt aus deinem Gewicht, der Widerstandsmessung der Waage, Größe, Alter und Geschlecht. Gut, um Trends zu verfolgen – keine medizinische Messung."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything that isn't fat: muscles, bones, organs and water. Your weight minus your body fat.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alles, was kein Fett ist: Muskeln, Knochen, Organe und Wasser. Dein Gewicht minus dein Körperfett."
          }
        }
      }
    },
